---
title: Chat and Delegation Flow
---
flowchart TB
    User([User message]) --> API[Chat API]
    API --> Interest[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>typed semantic memory agent]
    Interest --> Proposal[Visible memory proposal set<br/>no write before approval]
    API --> Selector{MainActionSelector<br/>one native tool call, all options together}
    Search_Tool[Live search_web schema] -.-> Selector
    Toolbox[User-registered<br/>MCP tools, shortlisted] -.-> Selector

    Selector -->|delegate_to_presentation_agent| Presentation[Queue durable<br/>PresentationAgent job]
    Presentation --> Progress[Return job ID<br/>and background progress]

    Selector -->|create_diagram| Diagram[DiagramAgent]
    Diagram --> Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    Inference -->|diagram role| DiagramModel[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>diagram call via vLLM]
    DiagramModel --> Artifact[Validate and persist<br/>Mermaid artifact]

    Selector -->|generate_image or edit_image| ImageAction[Generate or source-conditioned<br/>edit via ComfyUI FLUX]
    ImageAction --> ImageArtifact[Persist ready/failed<br/>image artifact]

    Selector -->|search_web, a toolbox<br/>tool, or neither| Memory[MemoryCoordinatorAgent<br/>memory and artifact retrieval]
    Memory --> Visual{Relevant stored<br/>image candidates?}
    Visual -->|yes| VisualPolicy[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>visual-memory selection]
    Visual -->|no| Context[Curated context]
    VisualPolicy --> Context
    Selector -->|search_web query,<br/>model-authored| Search[Privacy-screened<br/>internet search]
    Selector -->|toolbox tool| MCP[Guarded MCP<br/>invocation]
    MCP --> Context
    Search --> Context

    Context --> Inference
    Inference -->|main role| Main[Qwen 3.5 4B<br/>streaming call via vLLM]
    Main --> Persist[Persist completed turn<br/>and lifecycle updates]
    Persist --> Stream[SSE response]
    Proposal --> Stream

    Artifact --> Stream
    ImageArtifact --> Stream
    Progress --> Stream
    Stream --> UI[Visible answer, artifact,<br/>tool/search status, or job progress]

    Failure[Sanitized failure] -.-> Stream

